This repository contains the source code, design, stylesheets, scripts, data
schemas, interactive demos and illustrations of the AI in Medicine Lab (AIMLab)
website (the "Work").

The "Admin Component" is the admin panel and the local content server:
admin/, server.js, routes/, middleware/ and scripts/. It was co-developed and is
maintained by Chen-MouChin (Meng-Ching Chen) and Hsu-Cheng Wu (AIMLab CAG
Program). Hsu-Cheng Wu built its original foundation: the Express server, login
and token authentication, the data API, the Vue admin panel and its validators.
The Admin Component is jointly owned by Chen-MouChin and Hsu-Cheng Wu.

The rest of the Work is the original creation of Chen-MouChin, who holds all
copyright and economic rights in it.

In this licence, "Author" means Chen-MouChin for the Work as a whole and, for
the Admin Component, Chen-MouChin and Hsu-Cheng Wu jointly.

